flowchart LR
    A[Working Directory] -->|git add| B[Staging Area]
    B -->|git commit| C[Local Repository]
    C -->|git push| D[Remote Repository]
    
    D -->|git fetch| C
    D -->|git pull| A
    C -->|git checkout| A
    
    E[Untracked Files] -.->|git add| B
    A -->|git diff| B
    B -->|git diff --cached| C
    
    style A fill:#fff9c4
    style B fill:#ffccbc
    style C fill:#c8e6c9
    style D fill:#bbdefb
